  "summary": "Documented RustCrypto ML-KEM-768 implementation and interoperability tests. Atomic local DAG admission with parent ordering and backpressure. Boundaries: Nested packages and scoped instructions are not exhaustively inventoried. README v2 header explicitly says not production qualified, full release gate currently fails, and neither complete distributed consensus nor a post-quantum Nostr network is claimed. Historical marketing lower in README must not override the v2 status.",
